  "notes": [
    "Adding TY2026 must be a data change only (PHASES.md P10 exit criterion).",
    "Line 1z reports gross wages including tips and overtime exactly as printed on the W-2. The new TY2025 deductions are below-the-line on Schedule 1-A and this app does not compute them (CLAUDE.md §10).",
    "A mapping that would require deciding a characterization question routes to JUDGMENT instead (CLAUDE.md §9, §11).",
    "Boxes with no Form 1040 line (W-2 boxes 3-6) map to an INFO detail line, not to Judgment Required. Judgment Required is for questions a preparer must decide; padding it with routine payroll figures buries the items that actually need attention."
  ],
